# Minimal LLMInferenceService for SMOKE validation of the llmisvc subsystem.
#
# Goal: prove that the llmisvc-controller-manager reconciles a CR by
# creating the expected Deployment + Service (the controller-side wiring),
# without actually loading a real model.
#
# The model.uri below is a placeholder. The vLLM container the controller
# stamps from the kserve-config-llm-template will fail to pull/load the
# model (HuggingFace would return 404 for "kserve-tiny-test/placeholder"),
# but the Deployment + Service resources should still exist and let us
# inspect them.
#
# For PRODUCTION use:
#   - Install Gateway API CRDs as a cluster prerequisite (needed for
#     HTTPRoute creation on top of the Deployment):
#       kubectl apply -f \
#         https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/gateway-api/releases/download/v1.2.1/standard-install.yaml
#   - Replace model.uri with a real HuggingFace model id (hf://...) or
#     PVC reference (pvc://...). The bundled template targets vLLM-served
#     LLMs, which need substantial RAM/GPU even for the smallest
#     compatible model (TinyLlama-1.1B needs ~2 GB RAM).
apiVersion: serving.kserve.io/v1alpha1
kind: LLMInferenceService
metadata:
  name: llmisvc-smoke
spec:
  model:
    name: kserve-tiny-test
    uri: hf://kserve-tiny-test/placeholder
  replicas: 1
